   "url": "https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-all-smash-n-grabs-locations/",
   "note": "Read Nov 23, 2026 via ?p=372655 (published Nov 18, modified Nov 20 16:16 UTC, full text). 35 locations (20 jewelry, 15 pawn), 34 for 100%, part of A Long Road; each robbed at least once incl. back-room safe (display cases alone may not count); pawn shops after Coffee Break (Ch2), jewelry stores after Yasmani's Jewelry Jobs (Ch3); green icons, Map > Robberies > Smash 'n' Grabs, bright green done / dark green not; numbers, names, types, payout ranges and county groups as listed (PowerPyx files the whole city under Vice-Dale County). Locations only in screenshots: left out. Trusted source."
  },
  {
   "label": "PowerPyx: GTA 6 All Bank Jobs Locations (Bank Vaults)",
   "url": "https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-all-bank-jobs-locations-bank-vaults/",
   "note": "Read Nov 23, 2026 via ?p=372653 (dated Nov 18). 22 = 14 small + 8 large; small after Credit Check (Ch3), large after That's Where The Money Is (end of Ch4); small: cash drawer and safe; large: vault, cash drawer, safe; tail the armored security van; up to $205k; 4 stars at once; Map > Robberies > Bank Jobs; hover shows objectives done. Counties given for small banks only (Mariana 1-3, city 4-12, Leonard 13, Kelly 14). Yasmani van tip: $10,000 (the page's condition '2 payday loans' is already in the money guide). Trusted source."
  },
  {
   "label": "PowerPyx: GTA 6 All Payday Loans Jobs Locations",
   "url": "https://www.powerpyx.com/gta-6-all-payday-loans-jobs-locations/",
   "note": "Read Nov 23, 2026 via ?p=372654 (published Nov 18, modified Nov 20 16:16 UTC, full text). 7 locations, 6 in the city + Cash Flow in Kelly County; after Credit Check (Ch3), which gives the Dye Pack Jammer; green hand icon, Map > Robberies > Payday Loans; threaten teller, take cash from counter, rob the back-room safe, escape. Required for 100% / A Long Road. Trusted source."
  },
